{"server":"tw","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_03_beg","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_03","title":"意外之旅","storyCode":"GT-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"dc3559d6da8cb4a487ffa864dcf2689414d8c0b8ebda494099c0b33bb4ad45f8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"有了大鮑勃幫助，格拉尼二人得以順利前行，並遭遇了神秘幹員斯卡蒂後，卻沒料到斯卡蒂直接拔劍相向，眾人被捲入了一場大亂鬥中。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，你把我的同伴，全幹掉了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......別、別過來啊！求你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我把金幣都給你！我把我的武器給你！你要什麼我都——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個女孩子在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼——？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別靠近我——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你這個——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"晴 \\ 能見度 14公里\n塔拉特山前森林"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......這塊石頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個，跟上。小心腳底，跟著我的腳印走，手也不要到處摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"這片森林，恐怕比你我想的還要危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"石頭上是不是刻了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"這是賞金獵人留下的符號。不按照符號指示行動的話，就會踩進設置好的陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要直接躲開陷阱嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"看我的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"——絆索加捕獸夾，老土的小把戲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"樹叢恰好擋住了擺錘，一旦貿然前進就會被擊中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡，可蘿爾小姐，小心點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你再向前走一步，大概就會掉進滿是尖頭的深坑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是賞金獵人，很擅長這些嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然，畢竟我以前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"想要繞開陷阱是不現實的。果然，還是要全部解除掉才方便行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟他們最危險的道路，馬上就會變成對我們來說最安全的那種了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不太對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是陷阱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"沾血的符號......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"“——怪物？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"這什麼意思？這麼多年來，我都沒見過有人用過這個符號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不會吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怪物，怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別，別過來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂，你是斯卡蒂，沒錯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——原來滴水村村長是和你在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，什麼？你認識可蘿爾....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"把她交給我。現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼，她的眼神，不太對啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不行，我們應該談——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不，可蘿爾小姐，鮑勃大叔....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"她，她怎麼會攻擊你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是認識她，她怎麼就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"別問那麼多了！快，快跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈，她還在追著我們跑嗎？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"格，格拉尼，我，我跑不動了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"那個女人，真的，是怪物吧？她甚至，都沒在喘氣啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我要陪你們浪費時間？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的要砍了我，啊不，她要拿可蘿爾小姐幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可蘿爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"她的眼睛，好，好紅.....格，格拉尼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"不行了不行了，為什麼還會有這種事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是現在！放箭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"就是她，那個突襲我們的災星！快，快射她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你們給我住手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子想幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道為什麼她要追我，但好歹也是我的同事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“上尉”","speakerId":"avg_npc_008","isRemote":false,"text":"為、為什麼要壞我的事！混帳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在，快點走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鮑勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"——向東突圍！走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賞金獵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"別想逃出去！受死吧怪物！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿戈爾語）滾開!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？","斯卡蒂"]}]}
